  "id": "embassyhotelbar",
  "neon": "#ff2e8e",
  "note": "The second of the two NEWER buildings in the old east (see citadelfinancial.json for the first). A stepped tower with a chamfered crown — the same coincident-box trick as chromeclinic.json, used here only on the top two storeys so the building reads as an ordinary block that somebody re-capped rather than as a landmark. That restraint is the point: the east is meant to read a decade behind the glass west, and the way to say so is one or two things that plainly are not, not a skyline of them. RENDER_TUNE.legacyArms puts the embassy arm back.",
